OL,5,G0250 Bargain-Loving Brits in the Sun
OL,6,     FBar owner Shane has his first-ever
OL,7,     Fwedding booking at his outside
OL,8,     Fpoolside bar, catering for 200
OL,9,     Fguests, so he has a mammoth day
OL,10,     Fgetting everything ready.
OL,11,G0335 The Cruise: Fun-Loving Brits at
OL,12,G     Sea
OL,13,     FThe travellers visit the island of
OL,14,     FSantorini, where they experience
OL,15,     Fthe black sands of Perissa beach,
OL,16,     Fa calamari lunch, Profitis Ilias
OL,17,     FMountain, and a salsa lesson.
